# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# Q-019: the scope list is not fixed at startup -- 'Select folders…' opens
# the panel and any folder at all becomes a place the search is scoped to.
wait 10
key f ctrl
wait 6
click 410 373
wait 3
note the popup ends with the chooser
click 360 432
wait 6
note the panel goes home by its own key rather than by a row counted in
note the root listing, which is a different listing on every machine, and
note chooses the folder it is standing in
key h ctrl
wait 4
click 675 413
wait 4
expect-status scoped to /tmp/trk_home
quit
